1803
01:40:39,307 --> 01:40:41,768
[Gina] So, how do I look?

1804
01:40:43,144 --> 01:40:45,313
Um, like you're trying to get lucky.

1805
01:40:45,313 --> 01:40:49,108
- What? Is it too much? Should I change? - Mom, no. You look amazing.

1806
01:40:49,108 --> 01:40:50,610
And by "amazing" she means hot.

1807
01:40:50,610 --> 01:40:52,111
- [chuckles] - [doorbell rings]

1808
01:40:52,737 --> 01:40:54,655
Ooh! Get it!

1809
01:40:54,655 --> 01:40:57,909
Uh, tell Evan if he doesn't get you home by 11:00, you're in big trouble.

1810
01:40:58,743 --> 01:40:59,702
Big trouble.

1811
01:41:03,122 --> 01:41:05,458
Well, you are far too young to be my date.

1812
01:41:05,458 --> 01:41:06,459
[both chuckle]

1813
01:41:06,459 --> 01:41:07,835
[Davis] Hi, Mrs. Holmes.

1814
01:41:08,836 --> 01:41:10,004
Is Aza here?

1815
01:41:22,016 --> 01:41:22,975
[Aza] Davis.

1816
01:41:26,604 --> 01:41:28,314
I stole it from a lizard for you.

1817
01:41:33,945 --> 01:41:34,987
Thank you.

1818
01:41:37,573 --> 01:41:39,075
Aza, Noah and I are moving.

1819
01:41:42,495 --> 01:41:43,621
Where?

1820
01:41:44,580 --> 01:41:45,790
Colorado.

1821
01:41:47,291 --> 01:41:49,460
Noah got into a special school out there.

1822
01:41:51,712 --> 01:41:54,882
We just need a fresh start

1823
01:41:56,342 --> 01:41:57,343
after everything.

1824
01:41:59,804 --> 01:42:01,138
When are you leaving?

1825
01:42:04,141 --> 01:42:05,268
Tomorrow.

1826
01:42:08,729 --> 01:42:09,605
[Aza exhales]

1827
01:42:18,197 --> 01:42:19,448
You're a good brother.

1828
01:42:19,448 --> 01:42:21,701
[soft rock guitar music building]

1829
