It's a funny phrase, isn't it?

1830
01:42:32,503 --> 01:42:33,546
"In love."

1831
01:42:36,757 --> 01:42:39,302
You don't get to be in anything else.

1832
01:42:42,722 --> 01:42:46,601
In friendship, or in hope.

1833
01:42:50,187 --> 01:42:51,981
All you can be in, is love.

1834
01:43:14,295 --> 01:43:16,547
[softly] I think if I don't go now, I'll never leave.

1835
01:43:23,012 --> 01:43:24,013
Okay.

1836
01:43:31,479 --> 01:43:32,605
Goodbye, Aza.

1837
01:43:42,823 --> 01:43:44,992
[soft rock guitar music continues]

1838
